  "id": "noradrenergic",
  "term": "noradrenergic",
  "definition": "Noradrenergic refers to neurons or brain activity that use noradrenaline as a signaling chemical. In the brain, noradrenergic systems are described as broadly modulating cognitive functions such as attention, vigilance, learning, memory, decision-making, and executive functioning.",
